    card title "Where were you?"

A: How do you say where you've been around town, in Russian? Masha meets Tom in the evening; let's listen.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

B: Tom asks me: где ты была́, with the а for a woman, as in lesson eighteen.
    highlight talk2_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part была

    erase talk2

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw i_city w_city i_shop w_shop i_bank w_bank

A: Now round the town: го́род, магази́н, банк, университе́т. (@draw p_city p_shop p_bank i_uni w_uni p_uni@) Each just adds е: в го́роде, в магази́не, в ба́нке, в университе́те.

B: All four are he-words ending in a consonant, like рестора́н, в рестора́не, in lesson nine.
    highlight p_city p_shop p_bank p_uni effect underline color #d0865f

    draw i_stat w_stat p_stat

A: The station is the odd one: на вокза́ле, with на, not в. Learn it as one piece, like на рабо́ту.
    highlight p_stat effect underline color #8f887c part ^на$

    erase town

B: Вчера́ брат был в шко́ле.
    draw j_school v_school s1

A: Шко́ла ends in а, and the а makes way for (@draw q_school@) е: в шко́ле, as Москва́ gives в Москве́.

    erase s1 s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3 s1_g_4 s1_g_5

B: Ма́ма была́ на рабо́те.
    draw j_work v_work s2

    draw q_work

A: Рабо́та keeps its на: на рабо́ту on the way, на рабо́те once you're there.
    highlight q_work effect underline color #8f887c part ^на$

    erase s2 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4

    draw j_park v_park

A: In lesson twenty-seven, парк stayed as it was: в парк. Bu (@draw q_park@)t once you're there, it takes е too: в па́рке.

    erase places

    draw h_gde h_gde_s g1 g2

A: Now set today beside lesson twenty-seven. Where you are: в ш (@draw h_kuda h_kuda_s k1 k2@)ко́ле, на рабо́те; where you're going: в шко́лу, на рабо́ту.

    draw g3 g4 g5

B: The he-words: в па́рке, в магази́не, в го́роде when you're th (@draw k3 k4 k5@)ere, but в парк, в магази́н, в го́род on the way.

    draw g6 k6

A: And на stays на both ways: на рабо́те, на вокза́ле.
    highlight g2 g6 effect underline color #8f887c

A: So once you're there, nearly every place takes е. On the way, only the а-words change.
    highlight g1 g2 g3 g4 g5 g6 effect underline color #d0865f

    hide board

    draw qi_bank

    quiz "Tom was at the bank: Я был ___." reveal.text "Я был в ба́нке." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: He was there, so в and е.
        wrong: Was he there, or on his way? And is a bank like the station?
        * в банк
        + в ба́нке
        * на ба́нке

    erase qi_bank reveal_1_stamp

    draw qi_school

    ask "Masha's brother was at school yesterday. Type the missing word: Вчера́ брат был в ___." answer ["школе"] reveal.text "в шко́ле" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Шко́ле: the а of шко́ла makes way for е.
        wrong: Start from шко́ла; he was there, so what does the а become?

    erase qi_school reveal_2_stamp

    draw qi_stat

    quiz "Dad was at the station: Па́па был ___ вокза́ле. Which little word?" reveal.text "на вокза́ле" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The station takes на, like рабо́та.
        wrong: The station is the odd one, like work.
        * в
        + на

    erase qi_stat reveal_3_stamp

    draw qi_park

    quiz "Now Masha is on her way to the park: Ма́ша идёт ___." reveal.text "Ма́ша идёт в парк." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: В парк: on the way, a he-word stays as it is. В па́рке is for once she's there.
        wrong: Is she there yet, or on her way?
        + в парк
        * в па́рке
        * на парк

    erase qi_park reveal_4_stamp

    draw qi_city

    ask "Tom was in town. Type the missing word: Я был в ___." answer ["городе"] reveal.text "Я был в го́роде." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Го́роде: го́род just adds е.
        wrong: Start from го́род; he was there, so add the place ending.

    erase qi_city reveal_5_stamp

    group recap members ["r0","r1","r2","r3","r4"]
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap

B: А где вы бы́ли сего́дня? В го́роде? Пока́!
